This directory (src/liquid-glass/) contains a framework-agnostic vendor copy of the
liquid-glass WebGL renderer, adapted for the 梦幻画廊·昆仑灵鉴 project.

Upstream sources (both Apache-2.0):
- Web port:  martin65536/liquid-glass-webgl  (https://github.com/martin65536/liquid-glass-webgl)
              Web port developed by Z.ai Agent.
- Design & original Android implementation:  Kyant0/AndroidLiquidGlass
              (https://github.com/Kyant0/AndroidLiquidGlass)

The renderer core (renderer/, shaders/) is framework-agnostic TypeScript. The original
React host (context.tsx / catalog/) was replaced with a vanilla JS host (host.js) to
integrate with this project's Three.js front-end.

